    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$29$",
      "worked": "Numbers leaving a remainder of 4 when divided by 5 are\n$$4,9,14,19,24,29,\\ldots$$\nNumbers leaving a remainder of 5 when divided by 6 are\n$$5,11,17,23,29,\\ldots$$\nThe first number in both lists is $29$. Checking:\n$$\\begin{align*}29&=5\\times5+4\\\\29&=6\\times4+5.\\end{align*}$$",
